      "content": "Answer the following question with a single MySQL SQL query against the current database. Explore the semantic network and verify with mysql_query as needed. The SELECT list must contain exactly the columns the question asks for, in the asked order. When the final SQL is verified, call the submit_SQL tool with it.\n\nThe following hints are provided to help you write the SQL:\n\n## Gold Tables\n- SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY\n- SUBJECT_OFFERED\n- SUBJECT_SUMMARY\n- CIP\n- SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION\n\n## Column Mapping\n- offer department code: SUBJECT_OFFERED.OFFER_DEPT_CODE\n- 2012SU term: SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY.TERM_CODE, SUBJECT_SUMMARY.TERM_CODE\n- total units: SUBJECT_SUMMARY.TOTAL_UNITS\n- subject title: SUBJECT_SUMMARY.SUBJECT_TITLE\n- course number: SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY.COURSE_NUMBER\n- department name: SUBJECT_SUMMARY.DEPARTMENT_NAME, SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.DEPARTMENT_NAME\n- dense rank: SUBJECT_OFFERED.OFFER_DEPT_CODE\n- course: SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.COURSE\n- course description: SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.COURSE_DESCRIPTION\n- school name: SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.SCHOOL_NAME\n- program code: CIP.PROGRAM_CODE\n- program title: CIP.PROGRAM_TITLE\n- category code: CIP.CATEGORY_CODE\n- category title: CIP.CATEGORY_TITLE\n- four digit code: CIP.FOUR_DIGIT_CODE\n- four digit title: CIP.FOUR_DIGIT_TITLE\n- minimum warehouse load date: CIP.WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\n- department 6: SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.DEPARTMENT\n- total subjects: SUBJECT_SUMMARY.DEPARTMENT_NAME\n- total courses: SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.SCHOOL_NAME\n\n## Join Keys\n- SUBJECT_OFFERED.TERM_CODE <-> SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY.TERM_CODE\n- SUBJECT_OFFERED.TERM_CODE <-> SUBJECT_SUMMARY.TERM_CODE\n- CIP.PROGRAM_CODE <-> SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.CIP_PROGRAM_CODE\n\n## Question\nFor each offer department code in the 2012SU term with total units greater than 0, list the subject title, course number, department name, the dense rank over the offer department code, the course, course description, school name, program code, program title, category code, category title, four digit code, four digit title, and the minimum warehouse load date from the CIP table over each category code group for courses in department 6, and include a grand total of subjects per offer department code and a grand total for all courses in each school in the format (nulls for subject-specific fields, department name, total subjects, course-specific fields, school name, and total courses). Do not return any rounded answers."
